00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,166
Lewis took the proton out of the definition altogether.

2
00:00:04,166 --> 00:00:08,033
A Lewis acid accepts a lone pair of electrons.

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:10,299
A Lewis base donates one.

4
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:14,635
Neutralisation is the formation of a coordinate bond between them.

